      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹35.07 (up from ₹19.50 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹11.9b (up 23% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.58b (up 80% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 13% (up from 9.1% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
